{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, the hero suddenly becomes irresistible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405490/extras/Steam_ss_12.png?t=1747565946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> However, there is only one girl he has his heart set on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Can he overcome all kinds of love confessions and tell his feelings to that girl?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>How to play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Use all your skills to reject the girls in the school who try to confess their love to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405490/extras/Steam_ss_11.png?t=1747565946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> It's painful to refuse a girl's confession...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> But that pain will make you level up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You will get new skills as you level up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405490/extras/Steam_ss_02_EN.png?t=1747565946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Refuse the confessions of attractive girls and become a true heroine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405490/extras/Steam_ss_09.png?t=1747565946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405490/extras/Steam_ss_06_EN.png?t=1747565946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405490/extras/Steam_ss_08_EN.png?t=1747565946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405490/extras/Steam_ss_07_EN.png?t=1747565946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Genre \uff1aVampire Survivors-like 2D action and visual novel  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choice \uff1a There is no choice in the novel part, but there are some events that occur when you win or lose in the action part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play time \uff1a4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Distribution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is open for distribution and play-by-play! Please feel free to share your impressions of the game, your favorite characters, your thoughts on the ending, etc! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We would appreciate it if you could include the title of the game or a link to the game in the summary.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3405490?t=1747565946","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3405490?t=1747565946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405490/f6e7dfc5f2377e84552ef23bf20c799506711794/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747565946","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405490/f6e7dfc5f2377e84552ef23bf20c799506711794/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747565946","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, the hero suddenly becomes irresistible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat